Exemption for transported fuel and power
HB0311
sales-amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Locke, Brown, G, Lien and Lucas
AN ACT relating to taxation and revenue; providing a definition associated with
a sales tax exemption for power and fuel sales related to pipeline
transportation as specified; clarifying ownership requirements for the
exemption; requiring rulemaking; and providing for effective dates.
